# Derived and source-of-record artifacts never enter git.
#
# .work/ holds ~435 MB of 2017 originals plus every derived tier. The originals are
# the artwork's provenance and live in Photos.app + the archive drive; git is the wrong
# custodian for them. Only the code that regenerates everything is versioned — the same
# posture as apps/vision-board-studio/photos-restore.
.work/

# Compiled Vision extractor (rebuild with 1_vision/build.sh).
1_vision/danse-vision
1_vision/*.dSYM/
